## Extra packages for the headless Kali Live image.
## Required by the project specification:
## Sane Kali baseline (the minimal variant ships no metapackage at all;
## under 'default' this is already satisfied by kali-linux-default)
kali-linux-core
openssh-server
network-manager
wireless-regdb
iw
iproute2
avahi-daemon
curl
git
tmux
tcpdump
## WireGuard access channel (M1): the tunnel identity itself is generated on
## first boot and persisted to the KLHCONFIG partition — nothing baked, see
## README "WireGuard access".
wireguard-tools
dislocker
